OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's terror over mistaken HMO
OL,4,Agang attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,7,Fthere had been 25 attacks across
OL,8,FSalford on houses thought to be HMOs
OL,9,Fsince 5 October with most "racially or
OL,10,Freligiously motivated".
